From 9dafb727f7d4b36ae596a4182b19be9e275165a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 10:38:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(tests): fixtures and recorded refusals catch up with
 today's merges

rotary_law_tests built a Cutter without the neck field (#957); the eight
tormach-plasma recorded refusals held the pre-#1049 no-machine sentence.

Fixes #1146

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 crates/app/src/operation/rotary_law_tests.rs                    | 2 +-
 crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/tormach-plasma/arcs.refusal   | 2 +-
 .../tests/recorded/golden/tormach-plasma/drill_retract.refusal  | 2 +-
 .../tests/recorded/golden/tormach-plasma/empty_section.refusal  | 2 +-
 .../tests/recorded/golden/tormach-plasma/extreme_coords.refusal | 2 +-
 .../tests/recorded/golden/tormach-plasma/full_circle.refusal    | 2 +-
